Baselines.
We group baselines into three categories (full configuration in Appx. S4.3):
(i) closed-API reasoning models: Claude-4.6-Sonnet, Grok-4.1-Fast, Gemini-3.1-Pro, Gemini-3-Flash, and GPT-5.4-mini;
(ii) open-source large reasoning models: Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B Yang et al. (2025a), GLM-4.7-358B-32B Glm et al. (2024), DeepSeek-V3.2-671B-37B Liu et al. (2024), and Kimi-K2-1T-32B Team et al. (2025);
(iii) efficient reasoning methods: DEER Yang et al. (2025b), NoThink Ma et al. (2025), L1 Aggarwal and Welleck (2025), O1-Pruner Luo et al. (2025a), PEAR Huang et al. (2025a), and ETR Xiong et al. (2026).
